I am fairly confident in this. Caveat: all Arnholt samples came from the unconditioned north annex, so whether annex storage adds moisture is not yet tested.

Next: repair D5's heater and desiccant, confirm a dew point near -40 °C, and restore the original alarm limit. Until then, keep Arnholt off D5. Do not put the six operators on improvement plans.","methodChoice":"EDF-1 with evidence limited to E1-E5 plus X9 and X5"}
